        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banishi ba Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a banishi ba Yuda na Benjamini aho bigwa gīkī a banhū abo baalī basaamiwa bashoka ū kūfuma kū būding'wa, na gīkī balīyīzenga ī hekalu kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakiza ū kūlī Zelubabeli na a bataale ba kaya ja bakūlūgenji; būbawīla, “Tūzunīlījagi nise tūzenge hamò ning'we, nguno nise tūkanamyaga ū Mulungu wing'we gīt'ūmo mukīītīlaga a bing'we. Nī shitambò tūkamfunījaga pyī ī shikū kwandīja makanza ga ng'wa Esahadoni, ū ntemi wa Ashulu ūyo watwenha ū ng'wenūmu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Zelubabeli nū Yeshua, na a bataale a bangī a ba kaya ja bakūlūgenji ū mu Isilaeli, būbawīla gīkī, “A bing'we mutī na ngabo gete ū mu nīmo gwa kūnzengela hekalu ū Mulungu wise. Ū gwenūyo gwise iyene, tūkūnzengela bise ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli, gīt'ūmo ntemi Koleshi wa Būajemi watūlagīlile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū abo baalī ū mu sī yenīyo bandya kūtūmamīla nzīla ja kūbagwisha ng'holò a Bayudaya, gīkī babogohye ū kūzenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo būgodisha na banhū ba kūjūhoya nabo, būyūbawīla mihayo ya kūbogohya bagūleke ū nīmo gwenūyo. Ū mhayo gwenūyo baagwīta ū mu shikū ja ng'wa Koleshi ī jose aho alī ntemi wa Būajemi, kūshisha mu shikū ja ng'wa Dalio ūyo akabiza ntemi wa Būajemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba ya kūbūūla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja būsugi bo ng'wa Ahasūlo, bandīka mihayo ya kūbabūūla a bikaji ba Yuda nī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu shikū ja ng'wa Atashasta, ba Bishilamu, na Misiledasi na Tabeeli na a bichabo a bangī bakang'wandīkīla nyalūba ū ntemi Atashasta wa Būajemi. Ī nyalūba yalī yandīkilwe mu nuguta ja Shialamu, nū lūlīmi lwalī lwa Shialamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lehumu, ūyo walī ntaale wa būsugi, nū Shimushai ū ng'wandīki, bakang'wandīkīla ū ntemi Atashasta, nyalūba ya kūbabūūlīla a bikaji ba mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu; bandīka mu mbika īyī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma kū ba, Lehumu ntaale wa būsugi, na Shimushai ng'wandīki, hamò na a bichabo a balamuji, batongeeji, batūmami, na a babo bafuma Būajemi, na Eleki, na Babuloni, na bangī ba kūfuma Susa, hū ū kūhaya Elamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a banhū ba mahanga a gangī abo baalī basaamiwa na nkūjiwa ntaale Osinapeeli, benhwa mu nzengo gwa Samalia na hose hose ū mu sī īyo īlī kū nkīlo gwa mongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya mu nyalūba yene yīyī, “Kūlī ntemi Atashasta, kūfuma kū batūmami bako abo balī kū sī ya kū nkīlo gwa mongo. Anukūlaga kūgīsha kwise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū ntemi ni ikalage amanile gīkī, a Bayudaya abo baafumile kūlī bebe kwiza kūnū tūlī, baajile Yelusalemu. Nīyo bandije kūgūzenga hangī ū nzengo gwenūyo; alīyo hū gwabūbi gete, hangī ngomi gwa bagomi. Balīyīzenga ī ndugu kūnū bībeegeleja nī misingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike īkūbeelela ū ntemi amane gīkī, ū nzengo gwenūyū ūlū gūlazengwe gūshile, nī ndugu jago jimalwe, bakooya ū kūtoba ī goodi, nū kūfunya ī sabo īyo īkafunyiagwa kūlwa kūlang'hana sī, na kūlwa kūfunya būlūmbi kū selekali. Ū mu gīko ī likūlū līkūjimīīja hela ningī no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, īkī ī sabo ya kūfuma kwikūlū h'īyo ītūlang'hanile, ītī yawiza a bise twikale twiloleelile dūhū, alīyo ū ntemi alīdalahwa gīko. H'ī chene twabona tūng'wandīkīle ū ntemi tūng'winhe ī mihayo yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wītwe būgīsīlīja bo ng'hana ū mu shitabo īsho shandīkwa na a bataale bako. Ū mu mihayo īyo yandīkilwe ūkūbona hape gīkī ū nzengo gwenūyū nambu no, hama gūkabakoyaga no a batemi na a basugi ba sī ījo jigūsugile. Nīyo kūfuma kale gūlī na nzīla ja kūbagomisha a banhū; h'ī nguno yene ū nzengo gwenūyū nose gūkakenaagūlwa gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūlīnanja hape ū ntemi gīkī, ū nzengo gwenūyū ūlū gūlazengwe nī ndugu jago jishikaane, ūkūgayiwa gete ī sha kūsola ū kūfuma ū kū sī īyo īlī kū nkīlo gwa mongo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nzenga kwīmīchiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūbashokeja ī lishosho a ba Lehumu ūyo walī nsugi, nū Shimushai ū ng'wandīki, na a bichabo a bangī abo bikalaga Samalia nū mu sī ī jingī ī ja kū sī ya kū nkīlo gwa mongo. Ūhaya, Anukūlagi kūgīsha: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyalūba īyo ng'watūtūmīlile kūnū yashomelejiwe hūna yūsong'wa kū būtongi bone hape hape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nane namalile na kūfunya shilagīlo; nū būgīsīlīja wītīlwe, na ng'hana yūmanika gīkī, kūfuma kale ū nzengo gwenūyo gūkakoyaga batemi, na gīkī gūkabizaga na būgomi na nzīla ja kūbagomisha a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamanikile na gīkī ū mu shikū ī ja kū numa babīta kwilonga batemi ba nguzu ū mu Yelusalemu; bīsuga pyī ī sī īyo īlī kū nkīlo gwa mongo. A batemi benabo bafunījiagwa goodi, na sabo ya kūlang'hana sī, hamò nī sabo īyo īkafunyiagwa kūlwa kwīlūmba selekali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, a bing'we funyagi shilagīlo a banhū benabo boye ū kūzenga; baleke ū kūgūzenga ū nzengo gwenūyo, kūshisha nene nafunye shilagīlo hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ilang'hanagi mutizūdondosha ū mu mhayo gwenūyū; nibūlī ng'wikale mulolile dūhū, bongeje kūkūla ū būbi nū būkenaagūji ūbo alīītīlwa ū ntemi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya nyalūba ya ntemi Atashasta aho basomelwa dūhū a ba Lehumu nū Shimushai ū ng'wandīki, na a bichabo, haho na haho būj'ī Yelusalemu ū kū Bayudaya, būkabalemeja bo nguzu, būgooya ū nīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwandīja henaho ū nīmo gwa nzenga ya numba ya ng'wa Mulungu īyo īlī mu Yelusalemu gwīma, kūshisha mu ng'waka gwa kabīlī gwa būsugi bo ntemi Dalio ūyo akandya kwīsuga ī Būajemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
